  "details": "When someone sends you a group invite, you can see the name of the account that sent you the invite but you cannot go directly to their profile. If you want to find out more about who sent you the invite, you have to manually search their name.\n\nSome groups have taken advantage of this by using accounts with odd characters in the name to send out invites. The strange characters make it very difficult if not impossible to find out who sent it out.\n\nBelow is an example of this. First is the client and second is the website. The account name is \"̱̱̱̱̱̱̱̱̱̱̱ \" (12 unicode U+0331 characters). The name is unsearchable, so I can't view the profile of this account.",
